    {
      "id": "3L6GGHK2",
      "key": "3L6GGHK2",
      "version": 0,
      "type": "highlight",
      "text": "The representation consists of a list of learnable embeddings for scene objects, where each object is modeled as a local subgraph that includes the object itself and its nearest neighbors. These subgraphs are provided to the LLM as a sequence of triplets (object1, relation, object2). Semantic relations are encoded using features derived from the semantic edges of the scene graph, generated by state-of-the-art methods such as VL-SAT",
      "comment": "",
      "color": "#ff6666",
      "pageLabel": "2",
